        "ruleCards": [
          {
            "title": "Die of Ultimate Destruction",
            "content": "When you resolve an effect with the Ultimate Destruction icon (written [?] here), roll the Die of Ultimate Destruction and use the number rolled. If a card has more than one [?], roll separately for each. Rolling an X counts as 0 (no effect). A [?] BOOST value is rolled the same way when the card is used to BOOST. Without the physical die, roll 1d6 in Unbrewed and count a 6 as X (0) — this face mapping is an assumption, the die faces were not available."
          },
          {
            "title": "Doomsday Machines",
            "content": "Krang has 3 doomsday machine tokens: one starts active, two inactive. Flip a token to change its state. \"Activate a machine\": flip an inactive one to active (if all three are active, ignore it). Deactivating one after a roll lets you reroll the die. Krang's move value is 1 + the number of active machines."
          }
        ]
