        "ruleCards": [
          {
            "title": "Foot soldiers",
            "content": "A Foot soldier is deployed on a path: the line between two adjacent spaces (on a map without printed paths, put the token on the line joining the two spaces). Each path holds only one Foot soldier. Foot soldiers are not fighters: they cannot attack or be attacked, and fighters may move through them without stopping or taking damage. Shredder and Bebop & Rocksteady may attack any opposing fighter adjacent to a Foot soldier. When an opposing hero (not a sidekick) maneuvers and boosts, they may remove any number of Foot soldiers they move through (not with movement effects); removed Foot soldiers return to Shredder's supply. If the supply is empty, deploying does nothing."
          }
        ]
      }
